duce its relative probability."], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.6, "interrupt_relevance": 0.85, "level_role": "disease_class", "classification_axis": "etiology", "representative_diseases": ["acute lymphoblastic leukemia", "lymphoblastic lymphoma"]}, "B2.2": {"id": "B2.2", "label": "Lymphoblastic Lymphoma with Leukemic Involvement", "parent": "B2", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.10810800160389412, "posterior": 0.05481996488003756, "danger": 0.85, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": ["Normal glucose and lack of bone pain do not distinguish ALL from other blast-related diagnoses but reduce its relative probability."], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.8, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.5, "interrupt_relevance": 0.75, "level_role": "disease_class", "classification_axis": "anatomy", "representative_diseases": ["acute lymphoblastic leukemia", "lymphoblastic lymphoma"]}, "B2.3": {"id": "B2.3", "label": "Chronic Lymphocytic Leukemia (CLL) in Blast Crisis", "level": 2, "status": "closed_for_now", "posterior": 0.002, "danger": 0.9, "parent": "B2", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["Absence of chronic B-cell lymphocytosis (a hallmark of CLL) strongly argues against CLL in blast crisis compared to de novo AML."]}, "B3.1": {"id": "B3.1", "label": "Chronic Myeloid Leukemia in Blast Crisis (CML-BC)", "parent": "B3", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.1004908861262666, "posterior": 0.1004908861262666, "danger": 0.9, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.8, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.7, "interrupt_relevance": 0.85, "level_role": "specific_disease", "classification_a